ForceShield end-to-end: fire shields every alive house building (save format 74).

SuperweaponType::ForceShield was unwired in fire_superweapon_at (default:
false). Firing now sets iron_left_frames = [General] ForceShieldDuration=
(SwParams::force_shield_frames, default 750) on every alive building of the
firing house and emits SwEvent::Activated; the countdown is the existing
Iron Curtain expiry (step_air_naval), so damage is negated meanwhile via
the shared iron checks and the shield lapses on its own. Sidebar
charge/ready/arming need no change (generic HouseSuperweapon machinery:
sw_types/sw_ready/sw_charge_fraction, SpecialPlace, fshdicon cameo).
Buildings placed after the fire are NOT covered. Save format 74. Tests in
tests/test_force_shield.cpp (grant + fire + all-shielded + damage-negated
+ expiry).

